{"name":"Hypnotic","hex":"#687783","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hypnotic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or relating to hypnosis or hypnotism.","Capturing a person's attention to the exclusion of all else, as if placing them into a trance."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who is, or can be, hypnotized.","A soporific substance."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hypnotic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hypnotic","blocks":[{"text":"A hypnotic, also known as a somnifacient or soporific, and commonly known as sleeping pills, are a class of psychoactive drugs whose primary function is to induce sleep and to treat insomnia (sleeplessness). Some hypnotics are also used to treat narcolepsy and hypersomnia by improving sleep at night and thereby reducing daytime sleepiness. Certain hypnotics can be used to treat non-restorative sleep and associated symptoms in conditions like fibromyalgia as well."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Stilnoct2.JPG/330px-Stilnoct2.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypnotic","wikidata":"Q62962"},{"title":"Hypnotic (2023 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Hypnotic is a 2023 American mystery action thriller film directed by Robert Rodriguez, who co-wrote the screenplay with Max Borenstein. The film stars Ben Affleck, Alice Braga, J. D. Pardo, Hala Finley, Dayo Okeniyi, Jeff Fahey, Jackie Earle Haley and William Fichtner. Rodriguez also produced, co-shot, and edited the film, while his sons Rebel Rodriguez and Racer Max served as composer and producer, respectively."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/60/Hypnotic_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypnotic_(2023_film)","wikidata":"Q108872432"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/A_